'''Helpful spirit who?''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete a [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid at level 150 or above without relying on the [[Helpful Spirit]] for supplies.  The raid must be completed deathless by the entire party and will fail if any players in the raid use supplies from the Helpful Spirit.

==Strategy==
Bring a 4-dose potion of [[super combat potion|super combat]] and [[ranging potion|ranging]]. For a magic boost, bring an [[imbued heart|imbued]] or [[saturated heart]] instead. [[Ancient brew|Ancient]] and [[forgotten brew]]s can be used in place of the heart, but this will drain melee stats in the process.

As the player will not have access to [[smelling salts]] and [[liquid adrenaline]], be prepared to three cycle the Warden on phase 2. Other than that, the bosses can be killed fairly easily on a raid level of 150 with good gear.

